<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">个人空间</view>
  <view class="display about-title">我的</view>
  <view class="lead">暂不支持登录功能，持续建设中。</view>

  <view class="section-title">产品原则</view>
  <view class="principle-list">
    <view class="principle">
      <view class="principle-mark">需求</view>
      <view>
        <view class="principle-title">先问为什么，再看买什么</view>
        <view class="principle-copy">未确认需求，不推荐商品。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="principle">
      <view class="principle-mark">证据</view>
      <view>
        <view class="principle-title">不知道就说不知道</view>
        <view class="principle-copy">无评测原文，置信度不超过「中」。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="principle">
      <view class="principle-mark">克制</view>
      <view>
        <view class="principle-title">替代不是默认答案</view>
        <view class="principle-copy">需求清楚且路径更短才给。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">分析与搜索</view>
  <view class="principle-list">
    <view class="principle">
      <view class="principle-mark">分析</view>
      <view>
        <view class="principle-title">DeepSeek</view>
        <view class="principle-copy">追问、拆解需求、给出建议。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="principle">
      <view class="principle-mark">搜索</view>
      <view>
        <view class="principle-title">Doubao Search、Tavily</view>
        <view class="principle-copy">确认需求后检索价格与评测。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">隐私与数据</view>
  <view class="privacy">
    <view class="lead">分析发至 DeepSeek，服务端不存正文。记录只留本机。</view>
    <view class="lead">AI 判断仅供参考，价格请自行核对。</view>
  </view>

  <button class="secondary-button" open-type="share">分享给朋友</button>
</view>
